INSERT INTO `words` VALUES (336, 'figure out', '/ˈfɪɡjər aʊt/', 'figure out.mp3', 'phr.想出，弄明白', '594846e1429a0a314ec27ef3f09417e3_102116_1602215526.jpg', '', 'Let me figure out what I can make for dinner. OK', '让我想想我能做什么当晚餐。啊，想到了！', '23ec65e219daf35d98a636e681c8d24c_46483_1591081997.mp3', '', '2025-12-15 12:40:52', '2025-12-15 12:40:52');
